	"languages": {
		"english": {
			"app[content][about]": "[p][b]Place 1 of 3 nodes, find the best synergy, build your kingdom, and win the game![/b][/p][p][img src=&quot;{STEAM_APP_IMAGE}/extras/node-crown-gif&quot;][/img][/p][h2]Content[/h2][list][*][p]Around 500 nodes with different abilities, affecting other nodes. Along with them, a lot of interesting mechanics that can be used while discovering new builds,[/p][/*][/list][list][*][p]15 themed crowns - modes prioritizing specific &quot;factions&quot; - each one unlocks new mechanics and nodes for other crowns. They have a few stages with increasingly greater difficulty,[/p][/*][*][p]+50 artifacts - passive boosts unlocked at each stage of crowns - that can be selected before a run,[/p][/*][*][p]in-game events affecting the run,[/p][/*][*][p]a light detective story accompanying the player while playing,[/p][/*][*][p]meta upgrades - upgrades for groups of nodes - paid with the &quot;crystals&quot; earned in the game,[/p][/*][*][p]infinite stages after finishing the main story,[/p][/*][*][p]a lot of replayability![/p][/*][/list][h2]Demo Version Content[/h2][p]3 of 15 themed crowns along with all other content related to them (plot, artifacts, nodes etc).[/p]",
			"app[content][short_description]": "Node Crown is a roguelite focused on building a node-based kingdom.\r\nQuick runs designed for replayability, deep synergies, hundreds of nodes, and builds that make every run unique - you will find it here! Have fun!",
